  "details": "I noticed avatar height mismatching bug of tall avatars(>100m) caused by udon limits. Not sure why there should be limits in Udon when worlds already can force avatar height in their own range. \n\nIt only cause the bug and deprives freedom of making/using various sized avatars. For me, it even feels like discrimination toward size communities. \n\nSo I request removing this Udon limits so everyone can enjoy VRC more than before or after scaling update. \n\nThank you for reading this.",
